&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for someone with an early foundation in data analysis and digital business who is looking to develop deeper expertise in user growth, marketing performance, and funnel optimisation in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
