&lt;li&gt;Assist in evaluating the performance of multi-channel marketing campaigns across paid, organic, CRM, social, affiliate, and partnership channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the setup, monitoring, and analysis of A/B tests and other experiments, and provide clear summaries of findings and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare recurring and ad hoc reports, dashboards, and performance updates for internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track key business and marketing metrics, ensuring data accuracy and consistency across reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to support campaign analysis, growth initiatives, and business planning through data-backed insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market, competitor, and user trend analysis to support strategic decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify anomalies, performance gaps, and emerging opportunities through ongoing data monitoring and analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate data findings into clear and actionable insights for both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Statistics, Data Analytics, Economics, Mathematics, Marketing, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0–2 years of relevant experience in business analysis, data analysis, growth analytics, marketing analytics, or a related function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving skills, with the ability to work with data in a structured and detail-oriented manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of key digital business and marketing metrics, such as conversion, retention, CAC, ROI, engagement, and funnel performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel or Google Sheets for data analysis and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL, BI tools, or data visualization platforms is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to A/B testing, campaign analysis, user behavior analysis, or performance reporting is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual English/Mandarin is required to be able to coordinate with overseas partners and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, eager to learn, and comfortable working in a fast-paced and collaborative environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in user growth, digital products, and data-driven business strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
