&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive, organized and enthusiastic Regional PR &amp;amp; Communications individual to join our MENA team for a six-month opportunity. The role will provide hands-on exposure to regional public relations, influencer marketing, media relations, events and communications operations across multiple markets.&amp;nbsp;Working directly with the Regional Head of PR &amp;amp; Communications, this individual will support the coordination and execution of day-to-day communications activities, collaborate with external agencies and internal stakeholders, and help ensure the timely delivery of regional initiatives.&amp;nbsp; This is an excellent opportunity for an early-career professional looking to develop practical experience in a fast-paced, international environment within the technology and digital finance industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PR &amp;amp; agency coordination: Support day-to-day coordination with regional PR agencies, track deliverables, maintain activity trackers and follow up on deadlines and ongoing projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencer &amp;amp; KOL management: Assist in coordinating influencer campaigns, sharing approved briefs, tracking content submissions and publishing schedules, and consolidating campaign performance results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media relations: Support media outreach activities, maintain and update media databases, coordinate interview arrangements and follow up on media requests and coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events &amp;amp; executive engagements: Assist with planning and logistics for regional events, conferences, media engagements and leadership speaking opportunities, including registrations, scheduling and coordination with relevant stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; monitoring: Help compile weekly and monthly PR and influencer performance reports, monitor media coverage and maintain accurate reporting trackers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content &amp;amp; communications support: Assist with the coordination and distribution of communications materials, including press releases, media briefs and campaign content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administrative &amp;amp; operational support: Support vendor onboarding, invoice collection, payment tracking and other administrative processes related to PR agencies, influencers and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration: Work with internal teams, external agencies and regional stakeholders to ensure smooth coordination and timely execution of communications initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Communications, Public Relations, Marketing, Journalism or a related field, either completed or in progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years of relevant experience, with previous internships or entry-level experience in PR, communications, marketing, influencer management or event coordination considered an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous exposure to PR/communications agencies or the technology, fintech or digital finance sectors is preferred but not mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required to be able to coordinate with overseas partners and stakeholders. Additional languages would be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good organizational and time-management skills, with strong attention to detail and the ability to manage multiple tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, resourceful and eager to learn, with a collaborative and hands-on attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a fast-paced, multicultural environment and coordinating with multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Microsoft Office or Google Workspace, particularly Excel/Google Sheets and PowerPoint/Google Slides.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in technology, digital finance, media and emerging industry trends is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
